.TP
.BI "user move " "name group"
Move a user to a different group without changing the password. A move
that lowers the user's tier (see
.BR "group edit" )
syncs the accounts of this tacctl server at once. So do
.BR "user disable" ,
.BR "user remove"
and a
.B "user scope"
change that takes this server's scope away
.RB ( remove ", " replace ", " "remove \-\-all" ).
.\" BEGIN GENERATED: command user move
.RS
.PP
Requires: \fBsuperuser\fR.
.RE
