.TP
.BI "user verify " name
Show user details and verify the password interactively. A stored hash
with a bcrypt cost above 16 (tacctl writes 10\-14) is refused before the
password is asked, since checking it would take hours; tacquito still
authenticates it.
.\" BEGIN GENERATED: command user verify
.RS
