.B wti_level.<group>
one of viewonly, user, superuser, administrator. Default: none (unset).
The WTI access level of the group, in place of the one its priv-lvl band gives. Set with \fBtacctl group edit\fR or \fBtacctl group add\fR.
.TP
.B tier.<group>
one of readonly, operator, engineer, superuser. Default: none (unset).
The tacctl tier of the group, in place of the one its priv-lvl band gives. Set with \fBtacctl group edit\fR or \fBtacctl group add\fR.
.TP
.B breakglass_scope.<scope>.users
list of name:role entries, role one of admin, operator, readonly, at most 16. Default: none (unset).
The break-glass local users the scope's device configurations create. Only the names and roles are kept; no credential is stored. Set with \fBtacctl scope breakglass\fR.
