.B version
integer. Default: 1.
The format of the file; this release reads and writes 1.
.TP
.B tiers.<tier>
enable or disable. Default: enable.
Whether the tier gets the console as its login shell on this server (readonly, operator, engineer, superuser). Set with \fBtacctl console tiers\fR.
.TP
