true or false. Default: false.
Whether the escape character of the console's ssh stays on. Set with \fBtacctl console ssh\-escape\fR.
.TP
.B settings.system_shell
absolute path. Default: /bin/bash.
The program the console's system-shell word starts. Set with \fBtacctl console system\-shell path\fR.
